\f1\fs22 The gates opened at ten; by five-past, the Bubble Police\'92s training had proved to be severely lacking. In the face of thousands of people bearing tickets to a lawfully staged festival, they abandoned their posts, in part because they were Cloudborne themselves, but mainly because they were mostly rockabilly fans already, and were offered free tickets. Plus the Elvi were signing autographs and offering advice on which cocktails to avoid at the refreshment stands.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

